## Dataset Content License

The meme images included in `memes/` were collected from
publicly accessible Reddit posts. Individual images may be subject to their
original creators' copyright. These images are included under fair use for
non-commercial academic research purposes only.

Reddit discussion data is used under Reddit's terms of service for research
purposes. No personally identifiable information about Reddit users is
intentionally retained in this dataset.
